{"title":"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The triangular plot of ACD lies between Aspen Road, Brown Road and a railroad.  Main Street runs east and west, and the railroad runs north and south. The numbers in the diagram indicate distances in miles.  The width of the railroad track can be ignored.  How many square miles are in the plot of land ACD?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b3fa3817ad8d7032d6357d1446ffb5cfec46ac6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(250); defaultpen(linewidth(0.55)); pair A=(-6,0), B=origin, C=(0,6), D=(0,12); pair ac=C+2.828*dir(45), ca=A+2.828*dir(225), ad=D+2.828*dir(A--D), da=A+2.828*dir(D--A), ab=(2.828,0), ba=(-6-2.828, 0);  fill(A--C--D--cycle, gray); draw(ba--ab); draw(ac--ca); draw(ad--da); draw((0,-1)--(0,15)); draw((1/3, -1)--(1/3, 15)); int i; for(i=1; i&lt;15; i=i+1) { draw((-1/10, i)--(13/30, i)); }  label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, SE); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, SE); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, C, SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, SE); label(&quot;$3$&quot;, (1/3,3), E); label(&quot;$3$&quot;, (1/3,9), E); label(&quot;$3$&quot;, (-3,0), S); label(&quot;Main&quot;, (-3,0), N); label(rotate(45)*&quot;Aspen&quot;, A--C, SE); label(rotate(63.43494882)*&quot;Brown&quot;, A--D, NW); [/asy]\" width=\"278\" height=\"418\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/3/c03f211990d78b4ee2a307c01c1e5fe3266b17f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 4.5 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"363\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The area of a triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/1/fe12ba7774a2ce9a65df1808c0f5c56992e4b354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 bh$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"31\" height=\"37\" />. If we let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/4/0948661e822f2a953c43a57ac9e40b2734476de4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> be the base of the triangle, then the height is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, and the area is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/0/160908eab6a7a9d468be2b60339c15bd04a5496e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 3 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"151\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can see that there is a big triangle encasing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/e/6ce2cd123db24a7b8373999aea7a98927e3b3c81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ACD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. The area of that triangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/1/f313f42d9347199953e44fadb4ad435717bd2fd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 6 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"38\" />. We can easily see that triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/0/2a0f69aa4fa2a5215d09755bb0d860d11ef8b36b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe18900c777778ad24c84cb3d99df7032b4fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/2/c527059f52ec168e5335e3dcfb46085593e46f41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9-4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/b/0fbe18900c777778ad24c84cb3d99df7032b4fd3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/b/febf343be5908754615fdf594e432a42ffd474f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 4.5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Opz71P5o4uI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Opz71P5o4uI</a>  ~David\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/j3QSD5eDpzU?t=158\">https://youtu.be/j3QSD5eDpzU?t=158</a>\n</p><p>~ pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/QfQIqS60m5s\">https://youtu.be/QfQIqS60m5s</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 8\">2009 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2009\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2009_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2009 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?t